0..78 Comment "//! The completion subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
79..151 Comment "//! every source that reads them (`import \"./ring-base.gandr\";`): a mock"
152..231 Comment "//! kernel\'s submission protocol after io_uring, whose manual states that there"
232..307 Comment "//! is \"exactly one matching CQE for every SQE\" (io_uring(7)). A submission"
308..384 Comment "//! queue entry is received and one completion queue entry is posted; on the"
385..463 Comment "//! submitter\'s side, what remains after a submit is the pending completion it"
464..542 Comment "//! must reap. The buffer a read fills is moved into its submission and handed"
543..622 Comment "//! back with its completion, because the kernel owns it while the operation is"
623..668 Comment "//! in flight [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]."
669..672 Comment "//!"
673..716 Comment "//! - cites: [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]"
717..720 Comment "//!"
721..820 Comment "//! [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]: https://without.boats/blog/io-uring/ \"boats, Notes on io-uring\""
822..894 Comment "/// A ring: its entries sealed behind the interface, the protocol of one"
895..972 Comment "/// submission as the kernel serves it, the buffer and the pending completion"
973..1045 Comment "/// on the submitter\'s side, the protocols that take a buffer, a pending"
1046..1123 Comment "/// completion or a target\'s pending completion over a session, and one entry"
1124..1141 Comment "/// of each kind."
